# trybuild writes proposed expectations here when a compile-fail message
# changes. They are reviewed and moved into tests/ui/, never committed as-is.
wip/
.dust-extract/
# A vanilla server run directory, wherever an operator happens to leave one:
# the jars are Mojang's, the worlds are generated from them, and the logs are
# Mojang's too. None of it is this repository's to carry, and it is what both
# the protocol conformance test and the differential harness speak to. See
# crates/dust-protocol/tests/vanilla_conformance.rs.
.dust-vanilla/
